 R←Test_48(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;parms;folder;file;log
⍝ When the error folder cannot be created, the log entry must still be written: it does not need the folder.
⍝ The error folder is made impossible to create by putting it "below" a file. See also Test_31.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

⍝ Preconditions...
 folder←GetTempPath⊃⎕SI
 {}FilesAndDirs.RmDir folder
 {}'CREATE!'FilesAndDirs.CheckPath folder
 file←folder,'/AFile.txt'
 (⊂'Not a folder')⎕NPUT file
 #.⎕SHADOW'TEMP'
 'TEMP'#.⎕NS''
 #.TEMP.∆TheLog←''
 #.TEMP.⎕FX'{r}←∆CustomLogFns msg' '∆TheLog,←{1≥≡⍵:⊂⍵ ⋄ ⍵}msg'
 parms←##.HandleError.CreateParms
 parms.errorFolder←file,'/Errors'
 parms.killThreads←0
 parms.logFunction←'#.TEMP.∆CustomLogFns'
 parms.signal←501

 :Trap 501
     ##.HandleError.Process parms
     →T.GoToTidyUp 1
 :EndTrap

 log←#.TEMP.∆TheLog
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0=≢log
 →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/∨/¨'*** Error'∘⍷¨log

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 {}FilesAndDirs.RmDir folder
